{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","text":"AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence10DropReportO","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/DropReport","text":"DropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":"> { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports wait, without a bound, until they are read, so none is missed by reading late.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Drops are rare (each is a whole segment, or bytes recovery couldn’t read), so they don’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pile up. The sequence ends once the store is gone and every report has been read.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"One task reads the reports at a time. The first iterator to read holds them until its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iteration ends or it is released; a second reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"warning once, then reads on from the next report, so the first gets every report in order.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A reader cancelled while it waits returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/persistence\/segmentstore\/dropreports"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence","doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/SegmentStore"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Persistence\/SegmentStore.swift#L179","fileName":"SegmentStore.swift"},"externalID":"s:11Persistence12SegmentStoreV11dropReports11AsyncQueues0F5QueueVyAA10DropReportOGvp","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"DropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence10DropReportO"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"symbolKind":"property","title":"dropReports","modules":[{"name":"Persistence"}]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"A report of each drop, in the order they happen, from recovery onwards.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/SegmentStore\/dropReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Persistence/documentation/Persistence":{"role":"collection","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/persistence","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Keep each record on disk until it is delivered, so the records a tracker tracked survive the app ending.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence","title":"Persistence"},"doc://Persistence/documentation/Persistence/RecordStore":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RecordStore","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/persistence\/recordstore","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RecordStore","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where a tracker keeps each record until it is delivered, so records survive the app ending."}],"title":"RecordStore","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/RecordStore"},"doc://Persistence/documentation/Persistence/SegmentStore":{"title":"SegmentStore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/RecordStore"},{"type":"text","text":" that keeps records in a directory of append-only segment files, bounded in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"size, until they are delivered."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SegmentStore","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/SegmentStore","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/persistence\/segmentstore","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SegmentStore","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Persistence/documentation/Persistence/SegmentStore/dropReports":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence10DropReportO","text":"DropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each drop, in the order they happen, from recovery onwards."}],"url":"\/documentation\/persistence\/segmentstore\/dropreports","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/SegmentStore\/dropReports","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"dropReports"},"doc://AsyncQueues/documentation/AsyncQueues/AsyncQueue":{"title":"AsyncQueue","abstract":[{"text":"Elements in the order they are enqueued, kept until they are read; one reader at a time reads","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","url":"\/documentation\/asyncqueues\/asyncqueue","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Persistence/documentation/Persistence/DropReport":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DropReport","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/persistence\/dropreport","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DropReport","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Records a store dropped before they were delivered, and why.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/DropReport","title":"DropReport"}}}